      en: ["The hiking trail to Glacis Noir is about 1.4 kilometers long.", "All six endemic palm species of the Seychelles grow along the path.", "The summit offers a panoramic view of the eastern side of Praslin.", "The name is derived from the dark-colored weathered granite rocks.", "It is one of the premier locations to spot the Seychelles Black Parrot.", "The lookout tower was historically used to detect forest fires."],
