      en: ["Height of approx. 600 meters", "Surrounded by secondary tropical forest", "Often surrounded by mist"],
      es: ["Altura de aprox. 600 metros", "Rodeado de bosque tropical secundario", "Frecuentemente rodeado de niebla"],
