      en: ["Mont Harrison is situated in the mountain range of the Western Area Peninsula.", "The peak is part of Sierra Leone's state-protected forest reserve system.", "Its rock formations were created during the breakup of the supercontinent Pangaea.", "It is home to rare primate species, such as the red colobus monkey.", "The mountain acts as a natural filter for the region's rainwater runoff.", "Mont Harrison serves as a key navigational landmark for aviation in Freetown."],
      es: ["Altura: 400 metros sobre el nivel del mar", "Precipitación anual: 1600 mm", "Especie de ave endémica: Periquito de Rodrigues (Psittacula exsul)", "Número de cascadas: 3", "Área de captación de agua: 5 km²", "Altura de la cascada más alta: 15 metros"],
      pt: ["Altura: 400 metros acima do nível do mar", "Precipitação anual: 1600 mm", "Espécie de ave endémica: Periquito-de-rodrigues (Psittacula exsul)", "Número de cascatas: 3", "Área de captação de água: 5 km²", "Altura da cascata mais alta: 15 metros"],
      fr: ["Altitude : 400 mètres au-dessus du niveau de la mer", "Précipitations annuelles : 1 600 mm", "Espèce d'oiseau endémique : Perruche de Rodrigues (Psittacula exsul)", "Nombre de cascades : 3", "Surface du bassin versant : 5 km²", "Hauteur de la plus haute cascade : 15 mètres"],
